LINK Server
Copyright 2026 Song Youngwoon

This standalone LINK server implements experimental LINK Protocol 0.1 over TCP
and serves LINK World Standards v0.1 documents for LINK Browser.
An explicit legacy HTTP compatibility transport is also included.

